      "start_seconds": 5.18,
      "end_seconds": 8.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.87,
      "end_seconds": 24.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.17,
      "text": "mainly a high sugar test in pregnancy. There's a couple of other things but that's the main one. I did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.67,
      "end_seconds": 28.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.59,
      "end_seconds": 31.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I've had it since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.51,
      "end_seconds": 37.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "so, is it it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.16,
      "end_seconds": 41.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "about a six out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.48,
      "end_seconds": 45.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.16,
      "end_seconds": 53.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "it, It usually comes with a big baby on the scan"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.0,
      "end_seconds": 58.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.06,
      "end_seconds": 65.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I'm allergic to nickel, I get a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.76,
      "end_seconds": 69.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.61,
      "end_seconds": 80.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "I take lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.44,
      "end_seconds": 94.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.39,
      "end_seconds": 97.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "no surgery no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.73,
      "end_seconds": 115.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Alright, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.52,
      "end_seconds": 119.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.85,
      "end_seconds": 131.87,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.56,
      "end_seconds": 144.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.83,
      "end_seconds": 151.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "alright, any blurred vision, thirst or passing a lot of urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.44,
      "end_seconds": 155.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.15,
      "end_seconds": 160.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "have you had reduced baby movements, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.46,
      "end_seconds": 165.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "No, um, no reduced baby movements."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.88,
      "end_seconds": 170.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.15,
      "end_seconds": 173.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.97,
      "end_seconds": 191.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.58,
      "end_seconds": 199.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.21,
      "end_seconds": 221.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 76, pressure 128 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.04,
      "end_seconds": 224.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.81,
      "end_seconds": 229.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "right, we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.25,
      "end_seconds": 235.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Let me look at the the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.44,
      "end_seconds": 239.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.58,
      "end_seconds": 262.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "your blood pressure is normal and your urine has no sugar today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.06,
      "end_seconds": 269.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "all finished, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.81,
      "end_seconds": 309.64,
      "duration_seconds": 25.83,
      "text": "taking everything into account the most likely explanation is gestational diabetes controllable with diet i'd like to arrange a glucose meter and diary for gestational diabetes replace sugary drinks and white starches with wholegrains and walk after meals if the symptoms get worse or you feel really unwell please come to the emergency department"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.16,
      "end_seconds": 312.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.08,
      "end_seconds": 320.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "see me again in two weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.01,
      "end_seconds": 323.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
